# Devon (WorkPortal) -- H17.1/H18.1: keep Docker build contexts small and reproducible. Applies to
# every Dockerfile in this repo (root-context builds for apps/api, apps/web, apps/api/Dockerfile.worker).
# Keep local secrets and runtime data out of build contexts even when they exist in a developer's
# checkout; image inputs remain the tracked workspace source, manifests and deployment config.

.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-sourcemaps
**/.turbo
**/.pnpm-store
**/.cache
**/.output
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.data
**/.tmp
**/.scratch
**/.playwright-mcp
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
artifacts
backups
docs
agentic/ledger
e2e/screenshots
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy-secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.ppk
**/*.ovpn
**/*.kubeconfig
infra/certs
infra/telegram-tls
